<title>UK: UK broker Charles Stanley takes over McKean.</title>
<headline>UK broker Charles Stanley takes over McKean.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>London brokers Charles Stanley said on Monday that retail broking firm R.N. McKean was merging with it on March 3, 1997.</p>
<p>McKean has offices in Bedford and Reigate. Charles Stanley has branches in the south and west of England.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
